  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At its 220th session in October 2024, the Executive Board adopted 220 EX/Decision 44, which calls upon UNESCO to prepare an Action Plan covering all relevant fields of competence of UNESCO, to establish a Special Account for extrabudgetary funds for the   emergency   response   in   Lebanon, in   accordance   with   UNESCO&#x2019;s   Financial   Regulations. This Element concerns the Education component of this programme.</narrative>
